#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "VQD example {#vqd-example}"
msgstr "مثال VQD {#vqd-example}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we implement the Qiskit patterns framework, explicitly.\n"
msgstr "هنا نُطبّق إطار عمل Qiskit patterns بشكل صريح.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "الخطوة 1: تحويل المدخلات الكلاسيكية إلى مسألة كمومية {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now instead of looking for only the lowest eigenvalue of our observables, we will look for all $4$, (where $k=4$).\n"
msgstr "بدلًا من البحث عن أصغر قيمة ذاتية فقط للمرصودات، سنبحث هنا عن جميع القيم الـ $4$ (حيث $k=4$).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remember that the cost functions of VQD are:\n"
msgstr "تذكّر أن دوال تكلفة VQD هي:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"C_{l}(\\vec{\\theta}) :=\n"
"\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) | \\hat{H} | \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})\\rangle +\n"
"\\sum_{j=0}^{l-1}\\beta_j |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2\n"
"\\quad \\forall l\\in\\{1,\\cdots,k\\}=\\{1,\\cdots,4\\}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"C_{l}(\\vec{\\theta}) :=\n"
"\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) | \\hat{H} | \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})\\rangle +\n"
"\\sum_{j=0}^{l-1}\\beta_j |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2\n"
"\\quad \\forall l\\in\\{1,\\cdots,k\\}=\\{1,\\cdots,4\\}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is particularly important because a vector $\\vec{\\beta}=(\\beta_0,\\cdots,\\beta_{k-1})$ (in this case $(\\beta_0, \\beta_1, \\beta_2, \\beta_3)$) must be passed as an argument when we define the `VQD` object.\n"
msgstr "هذا مهم بشكل خاص لأنه يجب تمرير المتجه $\\vec{\\beta}=(\\beta_0,\\cdots,\\beta_{k-1})$ (في هذه الحالة $(\\beta_0, \\beta_1, \\beta_2, \\beta_3)$) كوسيطة عند تعريف كائن `VQD`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Also, in Qiskit's implementation of VQD, instead of considering the effective observables described in the previous notebook, the fidelities $|\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2$ are calculated directly via the `ComputeUncompute` algorithm, that leverages a `Sampler` primitive to sample the probability of obtaining $|0\\rangle$ for the circuit\n"
"$U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})$. This works precisely because this probability is\n"
msgstr ""
"علاوةً على ذلك، في تنفيذ Qiskit لـ VQD، وبدلًا من اعتبار المؤثرات الفعالة المُوضَّحة في الدرس السابق، تُحسَب الإخلاصات $|\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta})| \\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j})\\rangle  |^2$ مباشرةً عبر خوارزمية `ComputeUncompute`، التي تستعين بأداة `Sampler` الأولية لأخذ عينات من احتمال الحصول على $|0\\rangle$ للدائرة\n"
"$U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})$. ويعمل هذا بالضبط لأن هذا الاحتمال هو\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "p_0\n"
msgstr "p_0\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "& = |\\langle 0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr "& = |\\langle 0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "& = |\\big(\\langle 0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})\\big)\\big(U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle\\big)|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr "& = |\\big(\\langle 0|U_A^\\dagger(\\vec{\\theta})\\big)\\big(U_A(\\vec{\\theta^j})|0\\rangle\\big)|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "& = |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) |\\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j}) \\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"
msgstr "& = |\\langle \\psi(\\vec{\\theta}) |\\psi(\\vec{\\theta^j}) \\rangle|^2 \\\\[1mm]\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"

